  \\[\n   \\text{Average Speed}_{\\text{Angela}} = \\frac{1.4}{1} = 1.4 \\text{ units per unit time}\n   \\]\n\nComparing these values, we see that Carla has the highest average speed at 5.2 units per unit time.\n\nTherefore, the student with the greatest average speed is \\(\\boxed{\\text{Carla}}\\). However, there seems to be an error in the reference solution provided earlier. Based on the calculations above, the correct answer should be \\(\\boxed{\\text{Carla}}\\).", 'pred_raw': '\\text{Carla', 'extract_method': 'boxed', 'pred_norm': '\\text{Carla', 'gold_norm': '\\text{Evelyn}', 'correct': False}
